      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.1/p@4191",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DUKE.\nWhy so I do, the noblest that I have.\nO, when mine eyes did see Olivia first,\nMethought she purg’d the air of pestilence;\nThat instant was I turn’d into a hart,\nAnd my desires, like fell and cruel hounds,\nE’er since pursue me. How now? what news from her?",
